{"nodes": [{"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_slip_format_slip_format", "label": "The Slip - How to Hand a Finding to the Register", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/SLIP-FORMAT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One file per finding with SOURCE, ARTEFACT, TITLE and BODY, and no R number anywhere inside."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_slip_format_single_writer_register", "label": "The Register Is a Single-Writer Object", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/SLIP-FORMAT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four parallel chats once allocated ids from the same bank and three ranges collided, so a computing chat writes a slip and the register chat allocates the id."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_slip_format_refuse_not_coerce", "label": "Refuse Rather Than Coerce", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/SLIP-FORMAT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unbalanced markers, false entry headings, missing fields and self-numbered slips are refused rather than repaired downstream, and each refusal prints the entry that earned the rule."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_slip_format_bank_what_you_built", "label": "Bank What You Built", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/SLIP-FORMAT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Work produced outside the sealed tree does not survive its container; the Lowdin scripts and an entire press session reached no bank and had to be recovered from transcripts."}], "edges": [{"source": "extracted_projects_the_method_slip_format_slip_format", "ta